WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.920
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:05.680
That means Revolver, as the leader of the

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:08.350
Knights of Hanoi, will 
commit a historical crime.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:10.320
You’re fine with that?

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:15.130
If you can’t take responsibility 
for your actions...

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:17.860
...you should stop being Blue Angel.

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:24.240
Do you know where Playmaker is?

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.610
We don’t we don’t we don’t!

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:30.310
Then if you see him, bring him to me.

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:33.000
I'll end him in a duel.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.860
Wait right there!

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.990
Duel me first!

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:45.980
What's this?

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:04.720
I run Across the universe

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:07.890
At the speed of light

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:09.760
Begin Loading

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.500
Open the door of dreams

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.070
VRAINS spreads

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:20.170
Believe in myself

00:01:20.410 --> 00:01:23.710
VRAINS continues

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:29.020
The circuit draws the future

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:33.090
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:34.690
Access!

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:37.390
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:38.990
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.290
Link with my soul

00:01:41.390 --> 00:01:44.060
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:45.800
Now Win the Race

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:48.640
Connected world

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:52.140
No matter when

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:55.510
Nothing is impossible

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:59.650
Strive for hope

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:04.220
And ride the wind!

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:22.940
What's this?

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:25.590
What is it, Yusaku?

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:27.330
Look at this.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:36.080
That's footage of Another.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:39.500
Yeah.  But there's something else.

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:43.250
Someone’s there.

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.390
I’ll make it hi-res.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:51.360
That’s Aoi Zaizen's doctor when 
she was infected by the virus.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.320
Are you sure?

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.850
Margin of error 0.1%.

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:00.670
That's definitely her.

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:03.670
But why is she there?

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:05.320
Three possible reasons.

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:08.740
#1: She randomly happened to be there.

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:12.980
#2: She knows that man, 
so they came together.

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:15.970
But she abandoned him.

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:19.510
A doctor would've given 
him medical treatment.

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:23.790
And #3: A Knight of Hanoi came to watch.

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:26.150
That's probably it.

00:03:26.150 --> 00:03:29.610
Haven’t you learned to listen to the end?

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:30.600
I hate you!

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:33.490
Kyoko Taki, 30 years old.

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:37.310
She suddenly canceled 
tonight's schedule and left.

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:39.310
This is her home address.

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:45.770
If she’s a Hanoi, she must know something 
about the computer virus’s removal program.

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:47.510
Want to go?

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:48.880
Yeah.

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:05.930
It’s your turn.  Please draw.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:07.070
I know.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.200
My turn!  I draw!

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:18.300
Two monsters with fewer than 2000 DEF.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:24.180
Whichever I summon, Current Corruption 
Virus will drop its ATK to 0.

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:28.600
I set a monster!

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:34.680
Due to Dark Mummy Surgical Forceps’s 
effect, once during each of our turns...

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:38.370
...I can destroy a monster that 
was summoned, Special Summoned

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:41.130
or set next to your Link Monster!

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:49.100
That was destroyed too?

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:52.560
Now do you understand?

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:57.080
Sorry, but I won't lose to a child.

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:00.040
I end my turn.

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:02.460
Oh?  Done already?

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:10.190
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:20.090
When I draw a trap card, Surgical 
Forceps’s effect deals you 500 damage.

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:48.920
Whatever!

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:52.130
This amount of damage was nothing!

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:58.680
I’ll make you understand 
how cruel reality is.

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:00.150
I activate my Skill!

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.570
Forbidden Surgical Operation!

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:07.580
Opponent has activated her Skill.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:13.150
I banish two copies of a Level 2-or-lower 
monster from my graveyard...

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:18.390
...to Special Summon two copies of a 
monster with that Level from my deck.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:22.870
Appear, two Dark Mummy Infusers!

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:27.300
Whoa!  The Knight of Hanoi used her Skill!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:36.310
Dark Mummy Infuser's effect 
activates when it's summoned next

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:39.150
to a Zombie Link Monster's link.

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:42.450
As long as Dark Mummy 
Infuser is on the field,

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:46.010
Surgical Forceps isn’t 
affected by trap cards!

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:50.120
She’s even stopping my trap cards!

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:53.240
Surgical Forceps’s 
additional effect activates!

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:58.920
For every monster next to 
its link, it gains 600 ATK.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:04.120
3000 ATK!

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.590
I set one card.

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:07.840
That’s…

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:13.370
Due to the Continuous Spell, 
Temple of the Kings...

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:16.360
...I activate the trap 
card, Root Ransom Virus!

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:21.290
By tributing my Dark Monster with 0 ATK...

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:27.030
...Link Monsters' ATK drops to 
0, and their effects are negated.

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:37.360
Holly Angel has 0 ATK!

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:43.550
But Root Ransom Virus should affect 
all Link Monsters on the field.

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:48.010
Dark Mummy Surgical Forceps’s 
ATK remains at 3000.

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:54.490
Due to Infuser’s effect, Surgical Forceps 
isn’t affected by Root Ransom Virus.

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:58.600
A virus user always has a vaccine.

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:07.000
Battle!  Dark Mummy Surgical Forceps 
attacks Trickstar Holly Angel!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:11.400
The Continuous Trap, Trickstar Perennial!

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:16.210
By sending this card to the graveyard, 
Holly Angel isn’t destroyed!

00:08:16.810 --> 00:08:19.170
But you still take damage.

00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:32.160
Blue Angel barely survived!

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:34.920
By the skin of her teeth!

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:37.040
Aoi will be turned into Another!

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:39.160
Where are you going, Chief?

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:43.880
To LINK VRAINS and stopping 
this duel, of course!

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:46.600
What?  Why?

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:48.440
Why?

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:52.210
I won't let my sister put herself in danger!

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.510
Your sister is fighting with all her might.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:59.690
A brother's role is to watch her to the end.

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:04.750
...is what I think.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:15.810
You have 100 LP left.

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:17.480
I know!

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:22.030
If I send this card to the 
graveyard, I’ll have a chance.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:29.180
And I can do that by using my Skill.

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:35.890
But if Trickstar Fraud lets 
her draw even one trap card...

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:39.250
...Surgical Forceps will 
erase the rest of my LP.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:46.200
And since she uses viruses, she must 
have many trap cards in her deck.

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:49.000
It’s too late to do anything.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:52.240
You don’t have the slightest chance to win.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:53.840
Give up.

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:56.240
I’ll never give up!

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.680
I activate my Skill!

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:02.510
Trickstar Fraud!

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:04.480
Pointless.

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:10.080
Once per duel, I can discard 
a Trickstar during your turn.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:13.370
And I must draw until I have 
three cards in my hand.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:15.630
At the end of the turn, I must banish a

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:19.240
card from my hand for every 
Trickstar in your graveyard.

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:21.200
Trying to self-destruct?

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:24.070
I draw the first card!

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.720
If I draw even one trap card, I win!

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:34.380
I draw the second card!

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.760
Next is the final card.

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:47.730
I draw the third card!

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:57.340
Please!

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:05.510
No trap cards.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:06.840
All right!

00:11:07.820 --> 00:11:11.040
I sent Trickstar Mandrake to the 
graveyard to activate my Skill,

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:13.710
and now her effect activates!

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:17.830
I Special Summon her from my 
graveyard in defense position!

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:25.530
Gaining a monster now changes nothing.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.530
I end my turn.

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:29.280
Proceeding to End Phase.

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:32.100
Due to Trickstar Fraud,

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:37.280
I banish a card in your hand for 
every Trickstar in my graveyard!

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:45.260
Here comes the climax!

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:57.770
Hey, you’re really going?

00:11:57.770 --> 00:12:00.880
This might be Hanoi’s headquarters.

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:02.600
Even more reason to go.

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:05.340
Are you good at fighting?

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:07.350
See for yourself.

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:16.020
Room number?

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:23.320
Who are you here to visit?

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:29.020
Say something before it gets suspicious.

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:35.880
If you don’t answer, you'll 
be held under suspicion.

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:42.720
OK, Yusaku.  I took over the control system.

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:44.310
Understood.

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:47.010
Stop making me nervous.

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:52.210
C’mon, don’t be like that.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:03.530
Be careful, Yusaku.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.470
Straight ahead.

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:18.810
This is it.

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:25.080
Leave it to me.

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:31.000
If you sense any danger, leave.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.960
Too easy.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.990
No one’s here.

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:02.450
Be quiet.

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:15.580
My turn!

00:14:15.990 --> 00:14:18.310
Everything depends on this draw.

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:21.280
I draw!

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:24.740
Yeah!

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:30.560
I summon Trickstar Narkissus from my hand!

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:36.530
The trap card Current 
Corruption Virus’s effect!

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:43.760
The effects of your monster with 2000 or 
less DEF are negated, and her ATK becomes 0!

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:47.340
I only have 100 LP left.

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:49.870
This is my last chance!

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:55.320
Come out, the circuit of dreams and hope!

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:57.780
Arrowheads confirmed!

00:14:57.780 --> 00:15:01.250
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Trickstars!

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:07.860
I set Narkissus, Mandrake and Link 
2 Holly Angel in the Link Markers!

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:09.840
Circuit combine!

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:15.810
Appear, Link 4 Trickstar Bella Madonna!

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:37.280
Whoa!  In the final moments, Blue Angel has 
summoned a Link 4 monster for the first time!

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:40.890
So that’s your Link 4 trump card.

00:15:40.890 --> 00:15:43.860
A trump card should only 
be played at the end!

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:48.090
When Mandrake is used to Link Summon...

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:52.210
...the Infuser next to the Link 
Monster’s link is destroyed.

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:57.650
This effect activates from the graveyard, so 
it’s not affected by Current Corruption Virus!

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:04.980
Surgical Forceps’s ATK returns to normal!

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:11.270
Since Infuser’s effect ends, Surgical Forceps is affected

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:14.400
by your graveyard's Root Ransom Virus.

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:18.190
Her effects are negated, 
and her ATK becomes 0!

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:21.290
Similarly, Root Ransom Virus negates your

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:24.930
Bella Madonna’s effects, and her ATK becomes 0-

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:25.910
No, it won’t!

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:29.370
When there are no monsters next to Bella Madonna’s link,

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:31.870
she's not affected by other effects!

00:16:32.480 --> 00:16:34.140
What?

00:16:34.610 --> 00:16:36.780
Bella Madonna’s effect activates!

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:40.210
Once per turn, when there are 
no monsters next to her link...

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:46.290
...you take 200 damage for every 
Type of Trickstar in my graveyard!

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.290
There are six Types in my graveyard!

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:50.730
Go, Bella Madonna!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:59.440
How could this happen?

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:14.260
Is it because she hasn’t given up hope?

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:21.190
Her desire to keep fighting 
has created a miracle.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:30.270
Battle!  Trickstar Bella Madonna 
attacks Dark Mummy Surgical Forceps!

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:33.340
Shining Espoir!

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:36.340
This is the power of believing!

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:50.480
Excellent!  She made a huge 
comeback with only 100 LP left!

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:52.930
She did it!

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:53.950
Aoi…

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:03.250
This is the last door.

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:16.050
Bingo!

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:20.280
Kusanagi, she’s currently 
logged into LINK VRAINS.

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:25.520
She’s the Knight of 
Hanoi dueling Blue Angel.

00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:27.990
I knew it.

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:35.700
Blue Angel, you’re back.

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:42.260
No.  All I did was defeat 
you to get my revenge.

00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:45.090
I only fought for myself.

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:48.890
Blue Angel is back only for today.

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:51.730
Blue Angel...

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:54.520
Look at the sky.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:10.420
Yusaku!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.500
Kusanagi, look at that.

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:34.590
The Anothers are all recovering.

00:19:34.590 --> 00:19:37.220
The removal program has activated.

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:41.860
The removal program?  But why?

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:44.840
You changed my heart.

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:51.940
You may have fought for yourself, but 
that can change those around you.

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:57.920
If you carry the hopes of others, 
you’re fighting for everyone.

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:00.690
For everyone?

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:04.490
I used to be like that.

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:10.730
When I was young, I believed in 
my potential and ran without fear.

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:21.570
I immersed myself in my research to build 
a better world and a brighter future.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:28.110
I wonder when I changed…

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:36.600
She logged out.

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:40.290
When she wakes up, let’s ask 
her about the Knights of Hanoi.

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:44.120
Then let’s tie her up!

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:47.120
Yusaku, stop daydreaming.

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:49.140
Hurry up!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:53.070
Get ready, Hanoi!  I'm gonna pummel you!

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:54.080
Something’s wrong.

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:57.820
She’s not in LINK VRAINS, 
but she hasn't logged out.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:00.600
What's going on?

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:03.020
Yusaku!  Look!

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:10.280
The Hanoi purged her?

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:13.280
She knew this would happen 
if she released the program.

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:15.590
But she accepted the consequences.

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:17.990
Huh?  What do you mean?

00:21:17.990 --> 00:21:20.020
She felt guilty.

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:22.270
Felt guilty?

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:24.380
You don’t need to understand.

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:26.010
I’ll call an ambulance.

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:33.960
More news.

00:21:33.960 --> 00:21:40.120
For several days, LINK VRAINS users 
lost consciousness and became Anothers.

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:44.040
But last night, they've 
regained consciousness.

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:46.580
Umm…  Brother…

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:51.560
Thanks to Blue Angel, the 
Anothers have been saved.

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:56.490
Good job.

00:22:00.860 --> 00:22:01.960
Thanks!

00:22:08.820 --> 00:22:15.640
My life is like detestably bad graffiti

00:22:16.030 --> 00:22:22.780
But when you looked at 
me, I felt I wasn't alone

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:29.980
I'm glad that I'm alive  I truly am

00:22:30.510 --> 00:22:37.360
What I couldn't say before, I can say now

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:44.600
Within the sadness that I kept holding down

00:22:44.990 --> 00:22:48.730
There were fragments of power

00:22:48.990 --> 00:22:55.910
No one can take away my light to the future

00:22:56.170 --> 00:23:03.250
The chronicles of life only has a few lines

00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:10.460
People I meet, my regrets – they're 
all like ultramarine diamonds to me

00:23:10.710 --> 00:23:17.660
You've always confront loneliness by yourself

00:23:17.820 --> 00:23:24.540
I bet we can now laugh 
together, forever and ever

00:23:25.260 --> 00:23:32.240
Lighting Life with our invisible bond

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:41.240
Seasoned duelists gather at LINK VRAINS.

00:23:41.240 --> 00:23:45.310
And a new duelist rises here!

00:23:45.310 --> 00:23:49.170
An envoy of justice who saves 
the weak and crushes the strong!

00:23:49.170 --> 00:23:51.870
His name is Lonely Brave!

00:23:51.870 --> 00:23:55.480
Who is this mysterious man?

